[
  {
    "start": 44.2,
    "end": 73.8,
    "text": "Freud said, \"Love and work. Work and love. That’s all there is.\"",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        44.2,
        73.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 73.88,
    "end": 98.04,
    "text": "Well, I'm retired, and my wife is dead.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        73.88,
        98.04
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 98.12,
    "end": 122.32,
    "text": "As you can imagine, that's given me some time on my hands.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        98.12,
        122.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 122.4,
    "end": 139.08,
    "text": "My wife's been gone for three and a half years.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        122.4,
        139.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 139.16,
    "end": 152.08,
    "text": "I miss her in every way.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        139.16,
        152.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 152.16,
    "end": 181.4,
    "text": "And retirement? That is an ongoing, relentless effort in creativity.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        152.16,
        181.4
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 181.48,
    "end": 205.84,
    "text": "At first, I admit I enjoyed the novelty of it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        181.48,
        205.84
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 205.92,
    "end": 222.28,
    "text": "Sort of felt like I was playing hooky.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        205.92,
        222.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 222.36,
    "end": 241.92,
    "text": "I used all the miles I'd saved and traveled the globe.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        222.36,
        241.92
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 242.0,
    "end": 276.48,
    "text": "The problem was, no matter where I went, as soon as I got home, the nowhere-to-be thing hit me like a ton of bricks.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        242.0,
        276.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 276.56,
    "end": 297.28,
    "text": "I realized the key to this whole deal was to keep moving.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        276.56,
        297.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 297.36,
    "end": 324.08,
    "text": "Get up, get out of the house, and go somewhere. Anywhere.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        297.36,
        324.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 324.16,
    "end": 346.68,
    "text": "Come rain or shine, I'm at my Starbucks by 7:15.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        324.16,
        346.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 346.76,
    "end": 368.88,
    "text": "Can't explain it, but it makes me feel part of something.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        346.76,
        368.88
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 368.96,
    "end": 406.68,
    "text": "How do I spend the rest of my days? You name it. Golf, books, movies, pinochle.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        368.96,
        406.68
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 406.76,
    "end": 436.08,
    "text": "Tried yoga, learned to cook, bought some plants, took classes in Mandarin.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        406.76,
        436.08
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 436.16,
    "end": 462.56,
    "text": "Translation, \"Believe me, I've tried everything.\"",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        436.16,
        462.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 462.56,
    "end": 487.16,
    "text": "And then, of course, there are the funerals.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        462.56,
        487.16
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 487.24,
    "end": 503.32,
    "text": "So many more than I could imagine.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        487.24,
        503.32
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 503.4,
    "end": 539.92,
    "text": "The only traveling I do these days is out to San Diego to visit my son and his family.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        503.4,
        539.92
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 540.0,
    "end": 558.92,
    "text": "They're great. I love 'em to pieces.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        540.0,
        558.92
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 559.0,
    "end": 586.36,
    "text": "But to be honest, I think I probably relied on them way more than I should.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        559.0,
        586.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 586.44,
    "end": 605.76,
    "text": "Don't get me wrong, I'm not an unhappy person.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        586.44,
        605.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 605.84,
    "end": 619.96,
    "text": "Quite the contrary.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        605.84,
        619.96
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 620.04,
    "end": 640.36,
    "text": "I just know there's a hole in my life, and I need to fill it.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        620.04,
        640.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 640.44,
    "end": 674.8,
    "text": "Which brings me to today, when I was leaving the market and caught your flyer out of the corner of my eye.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        640.44,
        674.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 674.88,
    "end": 676.56,
    "text": "\"Seniors, be an intern.\"",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        674.88,
        676.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 676.64,
    "end": 702.0,
    "text": "Ben, I thought that was you.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        676.64,
        702.0
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 702.08,
    "end": 717.56,
    "text": "What'd you find?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        702.08,
        717.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 717.64,
    "end": 738.76,
    "text": "I think an Internet place is looking for senior interns.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        717.64,
        738.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 738.84,
    "end": 755.36,
    "text": "Am I reading this right? Let me see.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        738.84,
        755.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 755.44,
    "end": 828.28,
    "text": "\"Applicants must be over 65 years of age, have organizational skills, a genuine interest in e-commerce,\" whatever that is, \"and a roll-up-your-sleeves attitude.\"",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        755.44,
        828.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 828.36,
    "end": 831.72,
    "text": "AboutTheFit.com, isn't that the Outfit that Was...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        828.36,
        831.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 831.8,
    "end": 832.76,
    "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        831.8,
        832.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 832.84,
    "end": 851.72,
    "text": "They bought one of those old factories in Red Hook.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        832.84,
        851.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 851.8,
    "end": 873.76,
    "text": "My daughter says they sell clothes on the Internet.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        851.8,
        873.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 873.84,
    "end": 892.36,
    "text": "How that works, I have no idea.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        873.84,
        892.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 892.44,
    "end": 928.76,
    "text": "Well, you have to upload the application.That could be challenging.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        892.44,
        928.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 928.84,
    "end": 944.36,
    "text": "Listen to this, \"Cover letters are so old-fashioned.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        928.84,
        944.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 944.44,
    "end": 965.8,
    "text": "Show us who you are with a cover-letter video.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        944.44,
        965.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 965.88,
    "end": 1015.56,
    "text": "Upload your video to YouTube or Vimeo using.mov,.avi, or a.mpg file.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        965.88,
        1015.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1015.64,
    "end": 1043.52,
    "text": "We look forward to meeting you.\" Well, I guess that's meeting me.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1015.64,
        1043.52
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1043.6,
    "end": 1062.72,
    "text": "I swear I don't even know what language that was.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1043.6,
        1062.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1062.8,
    "end": 1078.96,
    "text": "What are you doing tonight, Ben?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1062.8,
        1078.96
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1079.04,
    "end": 1080.96,
    "text": "A frozen lasagna?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1079.04,
        1080.96
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1081.04,
    "end": 1124.12,
    "text": "I could make a little salad, turn it into a dinner for two, like we did that time and never did again.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1081.04,
        1124.12
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1124.2,
    "end": 1141.36,
    "text": "You know that was over five months ago?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1124.2,
        1141.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1141.44,
    "end": 1166.72,
    "text": "No, no, we gotta do that again, for sure, but okay if we take a rain check?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1141.44,
        1166.72
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1166.8,
    "end": 1180.0,
    "text": "You're awful cute, you know that?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1166.8,
        1180.0
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1180.08,
    "end": 1183.44,
    "text": "Well, it's true, you are.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1180.08,
        1183.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1183.52,
    "end": 1196.36,
    "text": "Don't take too long, doll.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1183.52,
        1196.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1196.44,
    "end": 1246.56,
    "text": "So here I am, applying to be one of your interns because the more I think about this idea, the more tremendous I think it is.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1196.44,
        1246.56
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1246.64,
    "end": 1267.4,
    "text": "I love the idea of having a place I can go every day.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1246.64,
        1267.4
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1267.48,
    "end": 1285.48,
    "text": "I want the connection, the excitement.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1267.48,
        1285.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1285.56,
    "end": 1307.44,
    "text": "I wanna be challenged, and I guess I might even wanna be needed.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1285.56,
        1307.44
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.52,
    "end": 1328.28,
    "text": "The tech stuff might take a bit to figure out.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1307.52,
        1328.28
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.36,
    "end": 1358.64,
    "text": "I had to call my 9year-old grandson just to find out what a USB connector was.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1328.36,
        1358.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1358.72,
    "end": 1373.8,
    "text": "Eager to learn.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1358.72,
        1373.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1373.88,
    "end": 1397.64,
    "text": "Also, I want you to know I've been a company man all my life.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1373.88,
        1397.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1397.72,
    "end": 1421.2,
    "text": "I'm loyal, I'm trustworthy, and I'm good in a crisis.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1397.72,
        1421.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1421.28,
    "end": 1436.64,
    "text": "And I love that you're right here in Brooklyn.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1421.28,
        1436.64
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1436.72,
    "end": 1479.04,
    "text": "I've lived here all my life, and lately I feel I may not be hip enough to live in Brooklyn, so this could help with that, too.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1436.72,
        1479.04
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1479.24,
    "end": 1499.16,
    "text": "I read once, musicians don't retire.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1479.24,
        1499.16
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1499.24,
    "end": 1517.88,
    "text": "They stop when there's no more music in them.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1499.24,
        1517.88
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1517.96,
    "end": 1547.16,
    "text": "Well, I still have music in me, absolutely positive about that.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1517.96,
        1547.16
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1547.24,
    "end": 1570.2,
    "text": "- Yep, these pants are awesome if you have hips. Super slimming.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1547.24,
        1570.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1570.28,
    "end": 1589.2,
    "text": "Okay, let me just review this with you.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1570.28,
        1589.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1589.28,
    "end": 1616.6,
    "text": "You have six bridesmaids. You ordered six of the silk chiffon Antoinette dresses in pink.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1589.28,
        1616.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1616.68,
    "end": 1651.24,
    "text": "The wedding is in three days, and the dresses just arrived all in charcoal gray.",
    "repeats": 6,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1616.68,
        1651.24
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1651.24,
    "end": 1674.48,
    "text": "Which we don't even sell, so that is a bit of a mystery.",
    "repeats": 6,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1651.24,
        1674.48
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1674.48,
    "end": 1687.6,
    "text": "Okay, here's what we're gonna do about this.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1674.48,
        1687.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1687.68,
    "end": 1705.76,
    "text": "I am gonna call the vendor and have this fixed today.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1687.68,
        1705.76
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1705.84,
    "end": 1753.36,
    "text": "I will personally see the dresses before they are FedExed, and I promise you they will be at your front door by 9:00 a.m. Friday, okay?",
    "repeats": 6,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1705.84,
        1753.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1753.44,
    "end": 1784.6,
    "text": "You know what, let me give you my cell just in case, 718-555-0199.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1753.44,
        1784.6
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1785.44,
    "end": 1818.12,
    "text": "Oh, thank you so much for your patience, and I am gonna refund you back all your money. it's the...",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1785.44,
        1818.12
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1818.2,
    "end": 1838.36,
    "text": "Okay, hey, you check this one off your list, okay? This is done.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1818.2,
        1838.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1838.44,
    "end": 1868.4,
    "text": "And, Rachel, have a great wedding.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1838.44,
        1868.4
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1868.48,
    "end": 1885.2,
    "text": "Oh, my God, how did that happen?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1868.48,
        1885.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1885.28,
    "end": 1887.16,
    "text": "I know, I know, I'm late for something.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1885.28,
        1887.16
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1887.24,
    "end": 1889.12,
    "text": "Yeah, everything.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1887.24,
        1889.12
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1889.2,
    "end": 1904.2,
    "text": "You see why I take customer service calls?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1889.2,
        1904.2
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1904.28,
    "end": 1923.84,
    "text": "You learn so much.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1904.28,
        1923.84
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1923.92,
    "end": 1924.84,
    "text": "What am I doing?",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1923.92,
        1924.84
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1924.92,
    "end": 1940.8,
    "text": "Okay, Cameron was waiting for you, but had another meeting.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1924.92,
        1940.8
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1940.88,
    "end": 1955.52,
    "text": "He said he'll be back at 2:00.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1940.88,
        1955.52
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1955.6,
    "end": 1979.36,
    "text": "Um, everyone needs you to sign off on tomorrow's homepage.",
    "repeats": 1,
    "occurrences": [
      [
        1955.6,
        1979.36
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "start": 1979.44,
    "end": 1996.68,
